    ('e', "**Renal replacement: CVVHDF or SLED (more stable); citrate is safe with monitoring.** Continuous modes avoid the haemodynamic swings and rises in intracranial pressure of intermittent dialysis. RRT is a bridge to transplant, not a cure; in non-candidates it is a goals-of-care decision."),
